---
// FastAPI reads the `case_id: int` annotation: "42" becomes 42 and the
// endpoint runs; "abc" is rejected with a 422 and the endpoint never runs.
const W = 900, H = 290;
function head(x: number, y: number) {
  return `${x},${y} ${x - 9},${y - 4.5} ${x - 9},${y + 4.5}`;
}
---
<figure class="bep1n2">
  <div class="bep1n2-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="FastAPI checks the case_id: int annotation before the endpoint runs. The path /cases/42 is converted to the integer 42 and the endpoint runs with a 200. The path /cases/abc fails the check, FastAPI returns a 422, and the endpoint function is never called.">
    <rect x="20" y="108" width="190" height="74" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="140" text-anchor="middle" class="t">GET /cases/{'{'}case_id{'}'}</text>
    <text x="115" y="162" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request arrives</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request tới</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 216 145 L 276 145" class="ln" />
    <polygon points={head(284, 145)} class="hd" />
    <rect x="290" y="108" width="230" height="74" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="405" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="t">case_id: int</text>
    <text x="405" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>FastAPI converts the text</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>FastAPI đổi chữ thành số</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 526 130 L 570 130 L 570 62 L 612 62" class="ln" />
    <polygon points={head(620, 62)} class="hd" />
    <path d="M 526 160 L 570 160 L 570 228 L 612 228" class="ln bad" />
    <polygon points={head(620, 228)} class="hd bad" />
    <rect x="620" y="24" width="260" height="76" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="750" y="54" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>/cases/42 becomes 42</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>/cases/42 thành 42</tspan></text>
    <text x="750" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>your endpoint runs, 200</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>endpoint chạy, 200</tspan></text>
    <rect x="620" y="190" width="260" height="76" rx="8" class="box redbox" />
    <text x="750" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>/cases/abc is not an integer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>/cases/abc không phải số nguyên</tspan></text>
    <text x="750" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>422, endpoint never called</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>422, endpoint không được gọi</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The annotation is the gate: bad input is turned away before your function starts.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Annotation là cổng kiểm tra: input sai bị chặn trước khi hàm của bạn chạy.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep1n2 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep1n2-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep1n2 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep1n2 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep1n2 .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep1n2 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep1n2 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep1n2 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep1n2 .redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep1n2 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep1n2 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep1n2 .ln.bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep1n2 .hd.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep1n2 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
